    M83
    G1 E-3 F1800
    M400 P500
  

  ; series of wipes to ensure the nozzle is as clean as possible to avoid potential z-drift issues.
  M104 S180
  G150.2
  G150.1 F8000
  G150.2
  G150.1 F8000
  M106 P1 S255
  M109 S180 A
  G150.1 F8000 
  M109 S140 A
  M106 P1 S0
  G150.1 F8000
  G91
  G1 Y-16 F12000
  G1 X100 F6000
  G90
  M400

